  "summary": "Hello, world! I am currently an app developer on the Internal App team at Skechers. I focus on building internal apps for sales reps and key people in Customer Service. I also created the image server for hosting product images.\n\nI graduated from UCLA with a bachelor’s degree in applied mathematics and specialization in computing. Ever since I was young, I always loved math. However, after I took my first programming class, I deeply fell in love with programming. After taking a few more classes, I found it as my true passion. As of now, I can program in six different languages: C++, Java, Scala, Swift, HTML, and JavaScript.\n\nMy goal is to be a full-time iOS developer and/or work at Apple!",
